# Installed by scripts/install.sh as /etc/apt/preferences.d/roxan-nvidia.
# Stay on the NVIDIA 580 branch, the last one supporting Pascal: every package of a newer
# branch (590, 595, 610, ... nvidia-driver-590, libnvidia-gl-595, linux-modules-nvidia-610-generic,
# nvidia-firmware-590-590.48.01, ...) gets no install candidate. 580.x point releases still flow.
# Globs rather than a /regex/: a regex here makes every apt invocation ~10 s slower.
Explanation: keep the NVIDIA driver on the 580 branch
Package: *nvidia*-59[0-9] *nvidia*-59[0-9]-* *nvidia*-6[0-9][0-9] *nvidia*-6[0-9][0-9]-* *nvidia*-7[0-9][0-9] *nvidia*-7[0-9][0-9]-*
Pin: release *
Pin-Priority: -1
